- Matches mockup in Mockups.md
- Enforces repair‑only messaging”

### Build GpsTabs Component
“Generate a React component `GpsTabs` with tabs:
- Tractors
- Trailers
- Technicians
- Drivers

Each tab must:
- Display live map
- Show unit list
- Show detail panel
- Update via `gps_update` events
- Match mockup in Mockups.md”

### Build EmergencyProtocolView
“Generate a React component `EmergencyProtocolView` that:
- Visualizes all 11 protocol steps
- Shows technician assignment
- Shows repair vendor selection
- Updates in real time
- Displays NO‑TOW banner”

